      "id": "brand.primary",
      "field": "description",
      "source": "UNDRR Blue. DELTA's own design system labels this swatch \"UNDRR Blue - Corporate blue\" and marks it Brand. 54 uses in DELTA's code, 1551 fills and 1645 strokes in its Figma file. It is rgb(0 79 145), identical to Mangrove's --mg-color-blue-900: DELTA's brand blue is UNDRR's.\n\nOnly defined by: delta, irp, preventionweb.",
